{
 "language": "en",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 5.02,
   "text": "Hey everybody, you want the secret to Persian delights?"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.94,
   "end": 13.32,
   "text": "Let's make some kubi there tonight, get your skewers ready, fire up the grill!"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.46,
   "end": 31.04,
   "text": "two pounds of lamb a beef with some fat three grated onions now how about that squeeze out"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.04,
   "end": 36.54,
   "text": "the juice don't let it stay we want that meat to hold its shape add salt and pepper season"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.54,
   "end": 41.94,
   "text": "it right a little turmeric if you like the bite keep it simple keep it real that's"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.94,
   "end": 43.92,
   "text": "Now you start a Persian meal"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.92,
   "end": 46.54,
   "text": "I mix it, mash it, work that meat"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.54,
   "end": 48.8,
   "text": "Knead it till the texture smooth and neat"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.8,
   "end": 50.86,
   "text": "Ten minutes strong, let the flavors unite"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.86,
   "end": 53.4,
   "text": "Cover and chill it, let it rest overnight"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.7,
   "end": 59.28,
   "text": "Kubi de, Kubi de, Persian kebab is on the way"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.94,
   "end": 61.58,
   "text": "On the skewer, on the flame"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.58,
   "end": 63.72,
   "text": "Smoky, juicy, that's the game"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.6,
   "end": 66.58,
   "text": "Kubi de, Kubi de, turn it fast"
  },
  {
   "start": 66.58,
   "end": 68.18,
   "text": "Don't let it fall away"
  },
  {
   "start": 68.18,
   "end": 70.48,
   "text": "Rice and butter, sumac too"
  },
  {
   "start": 70.48,
   "end": 73.96,
   "text": "Persian barbecue is waiting for you"
  },
  {
   "start": 76.64,
   "end": 78.86,
   "text": "Watch your hands now grab a ball"
  },
  {
   "start": 78.86,
   "end": 81.04,
   "text": "Presidentally spread it tall"
  },
  {
   "start": 81.04,
   "end": 83.4,
   "text": "Place the meat on a flat metal skewer"
  },
  {
   "start": 83.4,
   "end": 85.56,
   "text": "Shape it evenly, make it smoother"
  },
  {
   "start": 85.56,
   "end": 87.78,
   "text": "Pinch the ridges with your thumb"
  },
  {
   "start": 87.78,
   "end": 89.78,
   "text": "Make those classic grooves become"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.78,
   "end": 92.18,
   "text": "Seal the edges, hold it tight"
  },
  {
   "start": 92.18,
   "end": 94.28,
   "text": "Keep that meat up on the skewer right"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.12,
   "end": 97.08,
   "text": "Gotta get your charcoal glowing red"
  },
  {
   "start": 97.08,
   "end": 99.34,
   "text": "No big flames beneath the bread"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.34,
   "end": 101.66,
   "text": "Place the skewers side by side"
  },
  {
   "start": 101.66,
   "end": 103.82,
   "text": "Turn them quickly, don't let them slide"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.82,
   "end": 106.04,
   "text": "Flip them off and at the start"
  },
  {
   "start": 106.04,
   "end": 108.26,
   "text": "That's the secret, that's the art"
  },
  {
   "start": 108.26,
   "end": 110.44,
   "text": "Cook till golden juicy inside"
  },
  {
   "start": 110.44,
   "end": 112.96,
   "text": "No raw meat left when it's time to die"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.2,
   "end": 117.72,
   "text": "Grill tomatoes, charred and sweet"
  },
  {
   "start": 117.72,
   "end": 119.96,
   "text": "Fresh herbs make the perfect treat"
  },
  {
   "start": 119.96,
   "end": 122.26,
   "text": "Saffron, rice and golden light"
  },
  {
   "start": 122.26,
   "end": 124.36,
   "text": "Butter melting, what a sight"
  },
  {
   "start": 124.36,
   "end": 126.66,
   "text": "Sprinkle sumac, squeeze some lime"
  },
  {
   "start": 126.66,
   "end": 128.66,
   "text": "Gather round, it's dinner time"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.66,
   "end": 133.44,
   "text": "From Tehran Streets to Lanza Far, Persian Kubiede's the barbecue star"
  },
  {
   "start": 135.74,
   "end": 137.1,
   "text": "Kubiede, Kubiede"
  },
  {
   "start": 137.1,
   "end": 141.54,
   "text": "Made with love, the Persian way, onions, meat and charcoal, heat"
  },
  {
   "start": 141.54,
   "end": 144.24,
   "text": "Nothing beats this smoky treat, oh"
  },
  {
   "start": 144.24,
   "end": 145.94,
   "text": "Kubiede, Kubiede"
  },
  {
   "start": 145.94,
   "end": 148.34,
   "text": "Bring the family, shout hooray!"
  },
  {
   "start": 148.56,
   "end": 153.84,
   "text": "Saffron rice in kebabs divine, Persian flavor, every time"
  },
  {
   "start": 155.08,
   "end": 157.44,
   "text": "Remember the rule, now here's the key"
  },
  {
   "start": 157.44,
   "end": 159.38,
   "text": "Squeeze those onions."
  },
  {
   "start": 159.52,
   "end": 160.76,
   "text": "Knead carefully."
  },
  {
   "start": 161.5,
   "end": 164.22,
   "text": "Keep turning until the meat is done."
  },
  {
   "start": 165.46,
   "end": 166.7,
   "text": "Persian Kubida."
  },
  {
   "start": 167.74,
   "end": 169.28,
   "text": "Now that's fun."
  },
  {
   "start": 187.44,
   "end": 188.34,
   "text": "you"
  }
 ],
